  "description": "Open IHP SG13G2 130nm SiGe BiCMOS (HBT) - IHP (Germany); a growing choice for open analog/RF with real shuttle access. Mirrored under github.com/vyges-tools. The HBT/RF devices live in the primitives; this descriptor presents the digital sg13g2_stdcell view (mixed-signal/RF via the device models). This copy sits on the mirror's dev branch and describes the DEV tree, which since 2026-09-01 also carries the SG13CMOS-5L overlay (ihp-sg13cmos5l/) and ihp-common/ beside it - one checkout, one commit pin, and the cross-tree relative symlinks resolve. Tagged releases (v0.3.0 and earlier) remain on main and are what the catalog indexes as versions; dev is a commit pin, not a release. Name id uses underscore (ihp_sg13g2) per the descriptor name rule; the repo is ihp-open-pdk and root is its ihp-sg13g2 subdir. Paths illustrative."
}
